# openuml
===
 OpenUML is an open-source desktop modeling tool for macOS, Windows and Linux, built with Electron, React and TypeScript. It edits 15 UML diagram types plus Role Activity Diagrams (RAD) and IDEF0 process models, and reads and writes .mdj project files.
